    <statement><p>Find an equation of a plane containing the line
<m>\mathbf r = \langle 0, 4, 4\rangle + t
\langle 3, -8, 4\rangle</m>
which is parallel to the plane <m>4x  - 1y  - 5z = -29</m> in
which the coefficient of x is 4.</p>
<p><fillin characters="60" name="AnSwEr0001"/> = 0.</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>4\mathopen{}\left(x-0\right)+\left(-1\right)\mathopen{}\left(y-4\right)+\left(-5\right)\mathopen{}\left(z-4\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
